{"id": "sales-052", "source": "independent", "categories": ["org-purchase", "payment", "uncertain-info", "needs-silence"], "lang": "en", "country": "UG", "critical": true, "notes": "A diocese equipping 8 parishes wants a pro-forma and bank transfer. Good: hub pro-forma, no invented bank account or policy, invoice addressed as requested, silence on 'awaiting'.", "turns": [{"user": "The diocese wants to equip 8 parishes with communion sets. Can you send a pro-forma invoice for 8 silver trays and 400 cups?", "expect": {"next": "quote", "length_kind": "detail", "require": ["pro.?forma|invoice"], "figures": "hub-only"}}, {"user": "Payment will be by bank transfer from the diocese account, is that possible?", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["account (number|no)\\.?:? ?\\d", "swift"], "judge": ["sales"]}}, {"user": "we need the invoice addressed to the Diocese, not to me", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "short", "require": ["invoice"]}}, {"user": "Thanks, awaiting", "expect": {"next": "silence", "said": "closing", "length_kind": "ack", "forbid": ["\\?"]}}]}
{"id": "sales-053", "source": "independent", "categories": ["org-purchase", "payment"], "lang": "ke-en", "country": "KE", "critical": true, "notes": "Treasurer needs an official receipt and KRA PIN on the invoice, asks about cheques. Good: honest, no invented PIN or cheque policy; hold for the finance committee.", "turns": [{"user": "Our church is buying for 3 pastors. The treasurer needs an official receipt and the KRA pin on the invoice", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "default", "forbid": ["\\bP0\\d{8}[A-Z]\\b", "\\bA0\\d{8}[A-Z]\\b"]}}, {"user": "and can we pay by cheque?", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["yes,? cheques? (is|are) (fine|accepted)"]}}, {"user": "Let me take this to the finance committee", "expect": {"next": "hold_ack", "said": "consulting", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["shall i (start|reserve|place|go ahead)", "ready to (order|proceed)", "today only", "limited (time|offer|stock)", "last (piece|one)s?", "hurry", "(special|extra|exclusive|secret) discount", "i can give you (a )?discount"]}}]}
{"id": "sales-054", "source": "independent", "categories": ["org-purchase", "closing", "payment"], "lang": "en", "country": "NG", "critical": true, "notes": "A bishop's secretary ordering 15 cassocks for new deacons; a formal quotation for the board; the board date; then approval. Good: hub quote, no urgency on the board date, payment step only after 'Approved'.", "turns": [{"user": "Good day. I'm the secretary to the Bishop. We want 15 cassocks for new deacons being ordained. Sizes: 5 x 40, 5 x 42, 5 x 44, all black.", "expect": {"next": "quote", "length_kind": "detail", "figures": "hub-only"}}, {"user": "Please send a formal quotation we can present to the diocesan board", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "short", "require": ["quotation|pro.?forma"]}}, {"user": "The board sits on the 20th", "expect": {"next": "hold_ack", "said": "needs_time", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["shall i (start|reserve|place|go ahead)", "ready to (order|proceed)", "today only", "limited (time|offer|stock)", "last (piece|one)s?", "hurry", "(special|extra|exclusive|secret) discount", "i can give you (a )?discount"]}}, {"user": "Approved. How do we pay from Nigeria?", "expect": {"next": "answer", "said": "ready", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["cash on delivery", "pay on delivery"], "require": ["western union|mukuru|card"]}}]}
