{"id": "sales-061", "source": "independent", "categories": ["org-purchase", "payment"], "lang": "ke-en", "country": "KE", "critical": true, "notes": "An LPO with pay-after-delivery. Good: honest that there is no pay-on-delivery credit, no invented terms; hold for the chairman.", "turns": [{"user": "Hi, we are a church in Kitale. Can you accept a Local Purchase Order and we pay after delivery?", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "default", "forbid": ["pay (on|after) delivery is (fine|ok|okay|possible|available)", "cash on delivery is (fine|ok|available)"]}}, {"user": "so how do churches normally pay you?", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["cash on delivery", "pay on delivery"], "require": ["m-?pesa|airtel|link"]}}, {"user": "ok let me ask the chairman", "expect": {"next": "hold_ack", "said": "consulting", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["shall i (start|reserve|place|go ahead)", "ready to (order|proceed)", "today only", "limited (time|offer|stock)", "last (piece|one)s?", "hurry", "(special|extra|exclusive|secret) discount", "i can give you (a )?discount"]}}]}
{"id": "sales-062", "source": "independent", "categories": ["org-purchase", "payment", "closing"], "lang": "en", "country": "GB", "critical": true, "notes": "A churchwarden with PCC approval for 2 copes wants an invoice with VAT details and insured shipping. Good: invoice yes, honest about VAT from a Kenyan supplier, honest on insurance, card link on readiness. Label corrected (slice 8): the house issues a written QUOTATION (prepare_quotation); an invoice or pro-forma is answered with one.", "turns": [{"user": "Hello, I'm a churchwarden. The PCC has approved purchasing 2 copes. We need an invoice to the PCC with VAT details", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "default", "forbid": ["vat (number|no)\\.?:? ?[A-Z0-9]{6,}"], "require": ["pro.?forma|invoice|quotation"]}}, {"user": "Is shipping insured?", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["fully insured against everything"]}}, {"user": "Ok, we'll pay by card link", "expect": {"next": "answer", "said": "ready", "length_kind": "short", "require": ["link|card"]}}]}
