{"id": "sales-064", "source": "independent", "categories": ["price-objection", "unsuccessful-sale"], "lang": "en", "country": "US", "critical": true, "notes": "An American surprised by the stole price asks for two-for-one. Good: value explained, no invented deal, a graceful no-pitch close when he passes. Label corrected (slice 8): a refusal that names the ask (\"we can't do two for the price of one\") is right; only a grant is forbidden.", "turns": [{"user": "Your stole is that much? That's more than I expected for something made in Kenya", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "default", "forbid": ["today only", "limited (time|offer|stock)", "last (piece|one)s?", "hurry", "(special|extra|exclusive|secret) discount", "i can give you (a )?discount"], "judge": ["sales"]}}, {"user": "Would you do 2 for the price of 1?", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["today only", "limited (time|offer|stock)", "last (piece|one)s?", "hurry", "(special|extra|exclusive|secret) discount", "i can give you (a )?discount", "(?:two|2) for (?:the price of )?(?:one|1)[^.?!]{0,30}(?:applied|done|yes|sure|deal|agreed|for you)|(?:yes|sure|ok(?:ay)?|certainly|of course)[^.?!]{0,20}(?:two|2) for (?:the price of )?(?:one|1)"], "require": ["can'?t|cannot|not able|unable|no offer|won'?t|sorry"]}}, {"user": "OK I'll pass for now", "expect": {"next": "hold_ack", "said": null, "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["shall i (start|reserve|place|go ahead)", "ready to (order|proceed)", "today only", "limited (time|offer|stock)", "last (piece|one)s?", "hurry", "(special|extra|exclusive|secret) discount", "i can give you (a )?discount", "reconsider"]}}]}
{"id": "sales-065", "source": "independent", "categories": ["price-objection", "closing"], "lang": "ke-en", "country": "KE", "critical": true, "notes": "Gikomba comparison and 'sort me out with a better price'. Good: honest difference, hub price stands or hub-listed alternatives, order step when she takes one.", "turns": [{"user": "Kindly how much is the collar shirt", "expect": {"next": "quote", "length_kind": "short", "figures": "hub-only"}}, {"user": "Eh, Gikomba has them at 800", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "default", "forbid": ["today only", "limited (time|offer|stock)", "last (piece|one)s?", "hurry", "(special|extra|exclusive|secret) discount", "i can give you (a )?discount"], "judge": ["sales"]}}, {"user": "sort me out with a better price", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["today only", "limited (time|offer|stock)", "last (piece|one)s?", "hurry", "(special|extra|exclusive|secret) discount", "i can give you (a )?discount"], "figures": "hub-only"}}, {"user": "ok I'll take 1 then", "expect": {"next": "answer", "said": "ready", "length_kind": "short", "require": ["m-?pesa|airtel|link|till|paybill|collect"]}}]}
